{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf1_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf2_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf3_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf4_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Succession to the throne</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one can resist the temptation of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will play the role of an heir to a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the kingdom to greatness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Facing difficulties</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The continuation of the kingship is not smooth sailing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless difficulties are coming one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to carefully balance all aspects of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasury, army, people, resources, diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Make a choice-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision you make will affect the future of your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you a wise ruler who loves his people like his own children, or one who will do anything to achieve his goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you like it or not, you need to make changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Multiple endings</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each kingdom has its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the kingdom fall? Or rise? Or disappear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all up to you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you are interested in this game, you may click Add to Wishlist! It will be convenient to receive game releases, discounts, and the latest news at the first time!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3052480?t=1743690468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743690468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/1b9993ffec585f3a553485c19986224d25fd8a61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743690468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/1b9993ffec585f3a553485c19986224d25fd8a61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743690468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf1_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf2_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf3_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u5ba3\u4f20\u56fe\u50cf4_EN.png?t=1743690468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Succession to the throne</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one can resist the temptation of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will play the role of an heir to a kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the kingdom to greatness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Facing difficulties</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The continuation of the kingship is not smooth sailing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless difficulties are coming one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to carefully balance all aspects of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasury, army, people, resources, diplomacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Make a choice-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision you make will affect the future of your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you a wise ruler who loves his people like his own children, or one who will do anything to achieve his goals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you like it or not, you need to make changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-<strong>Multiple endings</strong>-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each kingdom has its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will the kingdom fall? Or rise? Or disappear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all up to you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you are interested in this game, you may click Add to Wishlist! It will be convenient to receive game releases, discounts, and the latest news at the first time!</strong></p>","developers":["huiFeng"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052480/header.jpg?t=1743690468","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highli